===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsoʊkəl/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|oʊkəl|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia}}

# {{lb|en|architecture}} A low [[plinth]] or [[pedestal]] used to display a statue or other artwork.
# {{lb|en|architecture}} A plain face or plinth at the foot of a wall.
# {{lb|en|algebra|ring theory}} The sum of the minimal [[normal]] [[submodule]]s of a given ''R''-[[module]] of a given [[ring]] ''R''.
# {{lb|en|group theory}} The [[subgroup]] generated by the minimal [[normal subgroup]]s of a given [[group]].

